# Errors

## INVALID_EXTERNAL_ID

```text
[INVALID_EXTERNAL_ID] "lib.js" is imported as an external by "main.js", but is already an existing non-external module id.
   ╭─[ main.js:3:40 ]
   │
 3 │ import { value as externalValue } from './lib.js'
   │                                        ─────┬────  
   │                                             ╰────── This import resolves to an external module.
   │ 
   │ Help: Make all imports of this module resolve the same way: all as external, or all as non-external.
───╯

```
